Generated code snippets — do not edit

`my_site_package/` is generated, not source of this manual.
`make codesnippets` posts `Build/DownloadSitePackage/data.json` to the Site
Package Builder at https://get.typo3.org/api/v1/sitepackage/, empties this
directory and unpacks the ZIP it receives.

**Do not fix anything inside `my_site_package/` here.** A change made here is
gone at the next regeneration, without a conflict and without a warning. The
file to change is `data.json`, which decides the package title, the TYPO3
version and the author details.

The `_codesnippets/` directories inside the chapters (`ContentMapping/`,
`FluidTemplates/`) are the opposite: hand-written fragments and diffs with no
upstream counterpart. Those are edited here as normal.
